{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Bar - A simple, aesthetically pleasing puzzle game set in a bar. It depicts the experiences of five beautiful and lovely girls after a night of drinking, accompanied by relaxing music. After completing a level, you can view the girls' photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game offers three puzzle difficulty levels: 2x2, 2x4, and 4x4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the &quot;F&quot; key to switch to black and white while solving a puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the &quot;Space&quot; key to complete the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- In the gallery, players can quickly view the girls' photos by pressing the A, B, C, D, or left/right mouse buttons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921030?t=1754451913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921030?t=1754451913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921030/6d93c6e00a60aed056790ef59ef27c49a1b6a1e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754451913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921030/6d93c6e00a60aed056790ef59ef27c49a1b6a1e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754451913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"- Nudity or pornographic content\r\n- Alcohol abuse\r\n- Contains female masturbation content\r\n- Clear depiction of male/female reproductive organs\r\n- Not suitable for viewing at work\r\n- Not suitable for all ages\r\n- All characters in the game are over 18 years old"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Bar - A simple, aestheti